llway door or fix its curled edge flat against the wall.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將走廊門口靠牆的地毯移除，或把捲起的邊緣貼平固定。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_f4ec491d-07bb-433b-a759-92aec93fbbd7","call_id":"call_f4ec491d-07bb-433b-a759-92aec93fbbd7","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H3\",\"instruction_en\":\"Move the black cable off the hallway door floor and secure it along the wall.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將走廊門口地板上的黑色電線移開，沿牆邊收好固定。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_cce19bb6-5bbc-4f0b-bdb0-57c3e05d6170","call_id":"call_cce19bb6-5bbc-4f0b-bdb0-57c3e05d6170","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H4\",\"instruction_en\":\"Move the black cable off the hallway door threshold and secure it along the wall.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將走廊門口門檻上的黑色電線移開，沿牆邊收好固定。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_95e880f3-df5b-4044-acdf-3fd4ca516b1b","call_id":"call_95e880f3-df5b-4044-acdf-3fd4ca516b1b","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H5\",\"instruction_en\":\"Move the long black cable off the hallway to bathroom floor and store it against the wall.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將走廊往浴室地板上的長條黑色電線移開，靠牆收好。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_7dd3e0e2-814f-400b-8be1-b31996883318","call_id":"call_7dd3e0e2-814f-400b-8be1-b31996883318","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H6\",\"instruction_en\":\"Move the white sneakers off the hallway to bathroom floor to a shoe cabinet.\",\"instruction_zh\":\"將走廊往浴室地板上的白色運動鞋移到鞋櫃。\",\"subsidy_code\":\"null\"}","status":"completed"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_2057510c-f7f2-4a5d-b72b-ef689794b7f0","call_id":"call_2057510c-f7f2-4a5d-b72b-ef689794b7f0","name":"draft_work_order","arguments":"{\"hazard\":\"H7\",\"instruction_en\":\"Move the white sneakers off the hallway to bathroom floor to a shoe cabinet.\",\"instruction_zh\":